# Verify the app still works

After build/dependency/config changes (and when finishing substantial app work), verify the app responds with HTTP 200:

1. Build: `npm run build`
2. Start production server on a non-privileged port, e.g. `PORT=3080 npm run start:production`
3. Run: `VERIFY_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3080 npm run verify`

The verify script must get **200 OK** for:

- `/` (Stue dashboard)
- `/entre` (Entre dashboard)
- `/andre` (2. etasje dashboard)
- `/api/read/temperature/loft` (temperature API)
- `/api/read/weather` (weather API)

Do not consider the task done if any of these fail. Stop the temporary server when finished.
